<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8221"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whatthehell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whatthehell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 9:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I AGREE THAT HE IS UNLIKE ANY OTHER. MY POINT IS JUST THAT. TO MEET THE DICTIONARY DEFINITION WE WOULD HAVE TO USE KILLINGS 2,3,4 BECAUSE BY DEFINITION SERIAL KILLERS ARE SINGLE KILLING OF MORE THAN THREE IN A ROW. BUT WE DIGRESS. <BR>THE POINT IS THAT I DO NOT BELIEVE THAT HIS KILLINGS WERE TOTALLY OUT OF A FETISH OR A SICKNESS. I THINK THAT HE WAS IN TOTAL CONTROL AS HE KILLED. NO SON OF SAM BARKING DOG STUFF. <BR>YES HE LEARNED TO LIKE KILLING AND YES HE FIT THE SHORT DEFINITION OF A SERIAL KILLER. <BR>HIS NEVER TRUELY HAD A REGULAR METHOD OF &#39;KILLING&#34; <BR>HE STABBED, SHOT, STRANGLED. NOT A SET MEANS LIKE GACY AND THE PANTIES.  <BR> <BR>I AGREE HE IS A EVIL MAN. I BELIEVE THAT HE IS MORE OF A PURE &#34; GRUDGE&#34; ANGER KILLER THAN HE IS A PROTOTYPICAL SERIAL KILLER. AT BEST HE IS ALWAYS IN THE SMALLER PERCENTAGES OF WHAT DEFINES A SERIAL KILLER.<a href="http://www.uplink.com.au/lawlibrary/Documents/Docs/Doc5.html" target=_top>http://www.uplink.com.au/lawlibrary/Documents/Docs /Doc5.html</a> <BR>THANKS FOR THE INPUT. SCHENSON2001 <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8221-->
