<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8235"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 10:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ok, your right I wasn&#39;t quite getting were you wanted to go. However I still have to disagree with you, there is to much evidence to support BTK is a sexual thrill killer. He in fact calls himself that, you might say he&#39;s misleading the police in doing that, I think he&#39;s just stating the obvious. The semen present on and around the bodies,  the poetry to his victims almost like love letters, this is one sick dude. He might have stayed at large longer then green river and gacy, bundy, all of them. But he&#39;s one of them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
