<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8786"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bakerwood<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bakerwood<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 7:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky,  <BR>Are you saying that the killer had access to personnel records in the 70&#39;s and 80&#39;s, or that old personnel records would be easier to get ahold of now? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8786-->
<!--Post: 9057--><!--Time: 1109388872-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9057"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 7:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky: Yes, those drugs were available then. And many more. I would think that the FBI or the police could get the records. He may not have been in a rehab program. He would not want anyone to know his secret. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9057-->
<!--Post: 9322--><!--Time: 1109474944-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9322"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whatthehell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whatthehell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 7:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->WOW, AFTER ALL THESE YEARS. AMAZING. IT WILL BE INTERESTING TO SEE HOW THE STORY UNFOLDS. HEY TEARDROP WE MAY HAVE BEEN ON TO SOMETHING. FOX NEWS JUST ANNOUNCED THAT HE WORKED FOR COLEMAN AT ONE POINT. DO ME A FAVOR READ MY ORIGINAL POST AGAIN AND LET ME KNOW IF THE THEORY AND THE PROFILE ARE NOT GETTING STRONGER ALL THE TIME? <BR>LOOK FORWARD TO HEARING FROM YOU. <BR> <BR>THANK GOD THAT HE HAS BEEN CAUGHT AND THAT THE FAMILIES MAY NOW HAVE SOME PEACE. MAYBE HIS OWN FAMILY CAN EVEN FIND SOME PEACE. <BR> <BR>LATER<!--/Text--></td></tr>
